Changelog v1.2.0–v1.2.1

- Fixed a w72 native stack trace error during playback.
- Fixed WebView touch input being intercepted by the miniplayer.
- Fixed a white flash when closing the miniplayer.
- Fixed the background playback toggle not working.
- Fixed YouTube watch history not being saved.
- Fixed the offline player getting stuck in landscape mode.
- Restricted the seek gesture to the middle portion of the screen to prevent accidental triggers.
- Reduced background resource usage during playback.
- Fixed action bar button visibility not updating correctly on the new watch page layout.
- Fixed the watch page context menu breaking layout and causing related video scroll when opened.
- Refined the custom landing page for LitePipe.
- Refined the tutorial dialog for better visibility on smaller devices and made sure the action buttons are accessible.(fixes #1)